":"Is mentioned in","inverseOf":"mentions"}},{"id":66981,"persistentId":"G4YeiU","category":"dataset","label":"Google Books N-Grams","description":"The Google Books Ngram Viewer is optimized for quick inquiries into the usage of small sets of phrases. If you're interested in performing a large scale analysis on the underlying data, you might prefer to download a portion of the corpora yourself. Or all of it, if you have the bandwidth and space. We're happy to oblige. These datasets were generated in July 2012 (Version 2) and July 2009 (Version 1); we will update these datasets as our book scanning continues, and the updated versions will have distinct and persistent version identifiers (20120701 and 20090715 for the current sets).","relation":{"code":"is-related-to","label":"Is related to","inverseOf":"relates-to"}},{"id":69140,"persistentId":"VUsxa0","category":"tool-or-service","label":"HathiTrust Digital Library","description":"The HathiTrust Digital Library offers public domain texts scanned from university libraries for the Google Books Project, in a variety of formats for search and browsing. Its research centre has developed a suite of tools and services for text data mining including web-based algorithms, freely-accessible datasets, and secure computing capsules. Access them from https://analytics.hathitrust.org/
